flowchart TB
  subgraph ticketflow-local
    API[api alias api :3000]
    W[worker same production image]
    M[migrate one-shot]
    PG[(postgres persistent volume)]
    R[redis]
    MQ[rabbitmq persistent volume]
    Mail[mailpit]
    M --> PG
    API --> PG
    W --> PG
    API --> R
    W --> MQ
    W --> Mail
  end
  Host[localhost :3000] --> API
  Frontend[Separate optional frontend network member] --> API
  Test[Isolated Compose project network and data] --> TestDB[(Separate test PostgreSQL)]
